/ ============================================================================
/ FLEXI ADMIN EXAMPLE: Bulk Action Modal Template — Export with form fields
/ ============================================================================
/ Modal templates can include form fields using either the FlexiAdmin form DSL
/ or raw HTML form elements. Field values are submitted as params to the Processor.
/ ============================================================================

= modal(context) do |m|
  = form do
    p
      ' Export
      span.count.fw-bold>
      | users to a file.

    / Use standard HTML form elements or the FlexiAdmin form DSL
    .form-group
      label.form-label Format
      select.form-select name="format"
        option value="csv" CSV
        option value="xlsx" Excel (XLSX)
